   "steps_unavailable": "Invariable adverb placed BEFORE the predicate. The record's formation says きっと is invariable and only states position (きっと ＋ [clause], near the start or before the predicate) plus which endings it co-occurs with (〜でしょう, 〜と思う); it derives from no base and inflects nothing. The op enum only transforms a base and suffixes material to it, so any step list would place きっと after the clause and generate the wrong order.",
