   "steps_unavailable": "Two-slot coordinator, not a derivation on one base. The record's formation is A または B: または stands BETWEEN two independently filled elements and applies no operation to either one. The op enum builds a single surface by transforming one base and suffixing material to it, so [noun, append または] would stop at *ペンまたは with the second slot unreachable.",
